{"c":[{"id":"afbc0885430f4042","sum":"G2-L1: never widen restates(); D2-06 scene 2 ends partial live. Guest fixture at x=0; no '--' in .entitlements; say 'at 3pm'; probe an EKEventStore if status flaps. No default chat route (--dev-writer); Gemma drafts few-shot.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"fdc428b470104795","sum":"G2-H8: restates() is a closed clause-suffix rule, never widen it; live Jev leaves D2-06 scene 2 partial. Guest 960x600: fixture to x=0; no '--' in .entitlements comments; event ⌘Z only after a verified step.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"6c27db8da975f9b4","sum":"G2: drafts.ts restates() is a closed clause-suffix rule; looser versions had 5 bypasses, never widen it. Live Jev confirmed Order number but not a reply's To sender or a derived event, so D2-06 scene 2 ends partial (evidence/screen/g2).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T173413Z-41b9cc8b0f0c0c83","text":"G2: drafts.ts restates() (skip Jev for a restated sentence) is a closed-frame clause-suffix rule; two reviews found 5 bypasses in looser versions (token sets, 'Avoid saying', 'NOT saying', 'provided'); never widen it by adding words.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T180513Z-82a90a8786c261a8","text":"G2: live Jev (Ask's yes/no value question, 0.75 floor) confirmed Order number but not a reply's sender in To or a derived calendar event for 'add this meeting to my calendar and draft a reply to Priya', so D2-06 scene 2 ends partial live; see evidence/screen/g2 jev-*-probe.txt.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"6064b9b210ca22b7","sum":"H8: guest is 960x600 pt, move a centred caret-fixture to x=0 or event cards find noClearSpot; seed-user-tcc.sh restarts tccd; no '--' in .entitlements comments; event card ⌘Z only after a verified step; calendar adds report written:0.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T182018Z-0c929a2ce63bdaff","text":"H8 VM: the rig guest is 960x600 pt; a centred caret-fixture executor window leaves every event-card spot covering a field (noClearSpot): move it to x=0 (fixture-ax move). seed-user-tcc.sh restarts tccd: running it while a TCC prompt is up shows the prompt twice.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T182018Z-327bc9cdd4327c33","text":"H8: an XML comment in an .entitlements file must not contain '--' (AMFIUnserializeXML refuses it and codesign fails). The event card's done line takes ⌘Z only after a verified step; the helper reports written:0 for calendar adds.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f5079ae2f5b9473e","sum":"H8-L1: say 'at 3pm' (an open AM/PM makes no event card); EKEventStore status can flap, probe a store. No default chat route; --dev-writer names one. Gemma E2B is a base model (few-shot drafts); deadlineMs is epoch ms.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"1c1ae9c575164268","sum":"H8: 'Thursday at 3' makes no event card since D2-03 (say 'at 3pm'); a card with no end asks how long. EKEventStore.authorizationStatus can flap notDetermined after a grant; host and reader probe a store instead.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T182018Z-f0560794b2ec28fa","text":"H8: since D2-03 an event sentence whose time leaves AM/PM open ('Thursday at 3') makes no event card; use 'at 3pm'. onscreen_acceptance.py still types 'at 3'. A card from a time with no end asks how long (30 min first, Tab takes it).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T182023Z-1d9814a513f71781","text":"H8: in a process running when Calendar access was granted, EKEventStore.authorizationStatus flapped notDetermined/fullAccess (VM) while a new store's calendars(for:) read fine; host and reader probe a store when status says notDetermined (no prompt).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f38309cb9958372d","sum":"L1: no chat route by default (writer routes null); a developer names groq:<model> or gateway:<model> via --dev-writer. Gemma E2B is a base model, so local drafts are few-shot; caret-local-model needs a grammar; deadlineMs is epoch ms.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T201333Z-b3e261779dc6c92b","text":"L1: no chat route is a default (WRITER_ROUTE and INTENT_ROUTE null, ASK_MAKER jev); a developer names one as groq:<model> or gateway:<model> (writer/routes.ts) with the helper's --dev-writer or an eval script's writer flag.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T201333Z-fdcac01d5471b677","text":"L1: Cotypist's Gemma E2B is a base model, so local draft prompts are few-shot documents (writer/local-draft.ts); caret-local-model refuses a request with no grammar. localTextRequest.deadlineMs is epoch ms, not a duration.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"00fd5ab66bea54da","sum":"H10-P2: page plans set WindowSel.page; host reads page focus from pageField only; label >80 blocks saved answers. Tests never read GROQ_API_KEY; new Ask makers join oneAnswer; recheckFields drops only failing fields.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"637b36e430ed09a4","sum":"H10-S1: page plans set WindowSel.page (page and reader windows share id and title); host reads page focus only from pageField. labelTooLong (label >80) blocks saved answers; old hosts lost the memory list on the answers doc id.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"1de8a2f92e9f1531","sum":"H10: a page window and its browser's reader window share bundle id and title, so page plans set WindowSel.page. Chrome shows AX no web content or focus, so the host reads page focus and frames only from pageField (PageFocusSource).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T203747Z-1771ea16bd50b7ed","text":"H10: a page window and the reader's window of the same browser share bundle id and title; plans for a page must set WindowSel.page or they stop as ambiguous.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T203747Z-8582de2538fa78c4","text":"H10: Chrome shows Accessibility no web content and no focused element while a page field has focus (VM probe), so the host reads page focus and frames only from the helper's pageField (PageFocusSource).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4168398783b277b0","sum":"S1: fill throws labelTooLong for a focused label over 80 chars on a page with little prose, so no saved answer there. Hosts before H11 refused the answers doc id and lost the whole memory list; answers.md is listed only to savedAnswers hosts.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T204550Z-12e324b0b44784bf","text":"Fill throws labelTooLong when the focused field's label is over 80 chars on a page with little other prose (privacy prose share); saved answers can't be offered there.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T204550Z-3e3d4d7a0bdec136","text":"Hosts before v2/answers throw on an unknown memoryDocument id, losing the whole memory list; the server lists answers.md only to hosts with the savedAnswers capability.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"d6e449e5f141c6b0","sum":"P1-P2: tests never read GROQ_API_KEY (no-groq.ts); a new Ask maker joins planAsk's oneAnswer gate; recheckFields drops only a failing field; derived parts keep their line's label as context, else need an equal line.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"796fd5afdca57f46","sum":"P1: no-groq.ts fails any test reading GROQ_API_KEY even if caught (pass env objects). On W4 Greenhouse, recheckFill refused Fill all: a derived Country part needs a line equal to the span for a control with no label context.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T205140Z-7ef033e31edcf1b4","text":"P1: helper/test/setup/no-groq.ts (vitest setupFiles) fails any test file that reads process.env.GROQ_API_KEY, even if the throw is caught; pass explicit env objects to readKey/writersOnStart in tests.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T205140Z-d6ebebc54b7a4ea1","text":"P1: on W4's saved Greenhouse pages Fill all is refused whole by recheckFill (offers/fill-popup.ts ~218): Country 'United States' is a derived part of 'Location: Oakland, California, United States (...)', and a control without label context needs a line equal to the span.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"59654fc6f3466291","sum":"P1-P2: the heads maker is one answer, so planAsk gates it like the writer; a new maker name must join that gate. A derived part carries its line's label as context; recheckFields drops only the failing field; sourceHolds re-derives spans.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261005T205140Z-f4ebc7703c97844e","text":"P1: the heads Ask maker (planner/intent-heads.ts) is one answer, so planAsk gates it like the writer (oneAnswer = makerName !== 'jev': inferredAll, listsAll, confirmScope); a new maker name must be added to that gate or its scope stands unconfirmed.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T220819Z-519d2cf2c3af807c","text":"P2: a fill part derived from one 'Label: value' line carries that label as FillHandoff.context; recheckFields drops a field that fails its recheck and runs the rest; an unlabelled span inside a longer line passes only if derive.ts re-derives it (fill-popup.ts sourceHolds).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
